 * An empty state placeholder.
// [🔬coda🖱️desktop💻renderer🔖renderer🔖components🔖emptystate🛠️emptystate](composerepo://p/r/coda/b/u/desktop/f/renderer.tsx/s/Renderer/s/Components/s/EmptyState/d/i/EmptyState)
 *
 * MUST display a message and optional action.
 **/
